35
00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:52,160
I had a job in the human world.

36
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:55,971
As you may have guessed, I
worked in the modeling industry.

37
00:02:56,420 --> 00:02:57,250
Uh, right.

38
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:02,380
Until one day, I was
involved in a motto mishap.

39
