But I wasn't in a position to choose.

44
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:31,460
After I consumed it, the
peach's power went haywire.

45
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,420
When I awoke,

46
00:03:38,780 --> 00:03:44,180
I had been carried to a dimly lit room,
and this creepy old woman was sitting

47
00:03:44,980 --> 00:03:46,840
