to hold on to my intellect for years.

78
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:50,600
When I had finally gotten things
under control, I met these guys.

79
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:52,586
That must have been horrible.

80
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:56,460
Now do you see why I had to rescue
you in such a convoluted way?

81
00:05:57,180 --> 00:05:59,340
Mato has a gristly dark side.

82
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:00,794
Something so terrible.

83
