her ability would be an ugly thing to do.

256
00:16:07,180 --> 00:16:09,920
So instead, I'll...

257
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:12,640
The Onmyo Bureau?

258
00:16:13,060 --> 00:16:14,500
Peach is backfiring.

259
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:17,260
Them studying all of the effects?

260
00:16:17,660 --> 00:16:19,760
I knew about their Shuki research,

261
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:23,357
but to think, they're doing something
so inhumane behind the scenes.

262
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:27,920
If what you're claiming is true, then
we'll destroy the Bureau. Believe me.

263
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:32,080
And we'll continue to do as we
please, killing anyone in our way.

264
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:36,477
Does that mean you still plan on
using Shuki to start an uprising?

265
00:16:36,560 --> 00:16:39,972
Well, what good would trusting
two cogs in the machine do?

266
00:16:40,100 --> 00:16:42,220
A lot of people are going to suffer.

267
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,562
We're the victims too, you know.

268
00:16:48,540 --> 00:16:51,360
Listen, I swear you can trust Miss Kyoka.

269
00:16:51,660 --> 00:16:52,778
She's my commander.

270
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:56,080
But she treats you as if
you're some kind of slave,

271
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:58,205
forcing you to do her bidding.

272
00:16:58,620 --> 00:16:59,450
That...

273
00:17:00,220 --> 00:17:01,800
That was my decision.

274
00:17:02,220 --> 00:17:06,000
I chose to become Miss Kyoka's
slave so that I can be a hero.

275
00:17:08,360 --> 00:17:10,340
I have to help my friends.

276
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:17,540
Then we'll use all our strength to stop
you. Miss Kyoka! I'm sorry. She's right.

277
00:17:17,860 --> 00:17:21,920
The Demon Defense Force would
do the same thing. Come on!

278
00:17:26,700 --> 00:17:27,530
Pixie!

279
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:36,320
The battle is about to begin.

280
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:38,340
Stay out of the way.

281
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:41,499
She cares about her little brother.

282
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:44,280
This is one opponent Yuki can't fight.

283
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:46,837
It would behoove him to not get involved.

284
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:49,320
Now then, shall we get started?

285
00:17:58,320 --> 00:17:59,820
It's the Unihorn.

286
00:18:00,020 --> 00:18:01,314
That one is all yours.

287
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:07,640
As it should be!

288
00:18:11,560 --> 00:18:13,340
So you're my opponent.

289
00:18:14,220 --> 00:18:16,060
Interesting. Oh, that's right.

290
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:18,066
I forgot to introduce myself.

291
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:22,180
I'm Tenka, commander of the Sixth
Squadron and Yuki's girlfriend.

292
00:18:22,600 --> 00:18:24,365
I'm your future sister-in-law.

293
00:18:24,540 --> 00:18:25,481
It's a pleasure.

294
00:18:30,300 --> 00:18:31,600
I'll kill you!

295
00:18:32,120 --> 00:18:33,720
I can't stop them.

296
00:18:34,040 --> 00:18:35,480
Damn it, this is bad!

297
00:18:36,560 --> 00:18:37,390
Mmh!

298
00:18:39,340 --> 00:18:41,237
Go with me!

299
00:18:41,320 --> 00:18:43,760
He's fast and strong, huh?

300
00:18:44,020 --> 00:18:45,667
What's the matter, princess?

301
00:18:45,980 --> 00:18:47,260
What? Yeah!

302
00:18:47,660 --> 00:18:48,860
Come and get me!

303
00:18:48,980 --> 00:18:51,280
Your attacks are sloppy and excessive!

304
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:54,440
So that's my best shot!

305
00:19:02,320 --> 00:19:04,080
Come on!

306
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:10,560
Gotcha!

307
00:19:14,180 --> 00:19:16,780
I'll crush you into itty bitty pieces!

308
00:19:20,060 --> 00:19:21,520
What the hell?

309
00:19:21,840 --> 00:19:23,737
This thing is tougher than steel!

310
00:19:23,820 --> 00:19:25,980
Well in that case, bam!

311
00:19:28,500 --> 00:19:30,097
Followed by...

312
00:19:30,180 --> 00:19:31,100
Boom!

313
00:19:37,540 --> 00:19:38,370
Huh?

314
00:19:38,620 --> 00:19:40,679
There's not a single scratch on it!

315
00:19:41,180 --> 00:19:42,700
It's no use.

316
00:19:42,940 --> 00:19:44,160
Kuma's invincible.

317
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:46,100
And I'm slimy.

318
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:48,127
Hitting us ain't gonna work.

319
00:19:49,460 --> 00:19:54,160
Which means we're the worst opponents
that you two could ever ask for!

320
00:19:59,260 --> 00:20:00,740
This one's mine!

321
00:20:01,060 --> 00:20:02,200
Golden Hour!

322
00:20:03,540 --> 00:20:05,000
Freeze five seconds!

323
00:20:08,080 --> 00:20:10,256
You were pretty good with that spear.

324
00:20:10,520 --> 00:20:11,600
Now say goodbye.

325
00:20:31,700 --> 00:20:33,560
Just a little parting gift.

326
00:20:36,560 --> 00:20:37,390
Uh-huh.

327
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:46,140
T-Mari!

328
00:20:54,840 --> 00:20:55,700
Shikoku.

329
00:20:57,560 --> 00:20:59,501
I found what we were looking for.

330
00:21:00,560 --> 00:21:01,700
Oh, wonderful.

331
00:21:03,500 --> 00:21:05,780
Nice job hunting them down.

332
00:21:06,560 --> 00:21:08,937
They're in combat with
the demon defense force.

333
00:21:09,020 --> 00:21:11,500
The demon defense force!

334
00:21:12,540 --> 00:21:16,360
It might be time to start
introducing ourselves as gods.

335
00:21:17,140 --> 00:21:21,040
Hark, humans and behold
her holiness has arrived.

336
00:21:21,620 --> 00:21:23,200
Well, how did that sound?

337
00:21:23,680 --> 00:21:26,740
Entirely devoid of dignity, really I!

338
00:21:29,100 --> 00:21:31,357
Will make us look divine
when we get there?

339
00:21:31,440 --> 00:21:33,040
Good plan

340
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:36,160
Well, shall we go?

341
00:22:10,400 --> 00:22:13,200
Thank you.

342
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:43,720
Thank you.

343
00:23:03,040 --> 00:23:04,452
I don't want to go back.

344
00:23:33,040 --> 00:23:34,157
and I'm moving objects.

345
00:23:34,240 --> 00:23:35,737
Oh crap, our cover's blood!

346
00:23:35,820 --> 00:23:38,137
Next time, death badge, Owl the Excite!

347
00:23:38,220 --> 00:23:39,985
You pink, Demon Defense Force!
